      "normalizedSource": "The default implementation of this method checks to see if autosaving is turned on and, if so and if `[self hasUnautosavedChanges]` returns [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true), schedules an `NSTimer` to invoke [`autosave(withDelegate:didAutosave:contextInfo:)`](nsdocument/autosave(withdelegate:didautosave:contextinfo:).md) in the future.",
